<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 8, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', padding: '16px 40px 8px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>演示实录 ④ · 认知助产（L3）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8' }}>系统真实运行界面 · 未作修饰</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, padding: '2px 40px 0 40px' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Image src="assets/demo4_l3a.png" style={{ width: 386, height: 350, objectFit: 'contain', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }} />
            <Image src="assets/demo4_l3b.png" style={{ width: 474, height: 350, objectFit: 'contain', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ padding: '14px 20px', background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>这一步在做什么：</span>这一层不回答「你想知道什么」，而是提出<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>你该问但没问的问题</span>——先算出结构信号（重复录入、层级失衡、冲突率接近零），再把每条追问写成「为什么问 + 数据依据 + 可以做什么」，人是拿着它去行动，不是听一句空泛建议。
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 124, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '4px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '14px 18px', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>结构信号先本地算</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>主题分布、重复片段、层级失衡与冲突率是本地统计，不消耗模型调用。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 124, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '4px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '14px 18px', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>追问必须带依据</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>每条追问都附数据与出处，可核查——避免「听起来很有道理」的空话。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 124, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '4px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '14px 18px', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>与 L2 联动</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>冲突率接近零本身就是信号——说明你在回避让你不适的材料。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', padding: '10px 40px 14px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>认知副驾 · Cognitive Copilot</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>24 / 27</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
